# Scenario 'mail_server_hidden2': the hidden variant of メールサーバ (SELECT+LEFT held, see 'mail_server_hidden') with its other two buttons.
# Run 1: first button "かくにんしてからけす" (22:4000 -> MailSrvDelHidden_CheckAndDelete): connect, TOP each of the five mails, per-mail icon bar
# (the check screen of 2E:4000: delete / next / end), result screens. Run 2 (after a power cycle): second button "じどうでぜんぶけす"
# (MailSrvDelHidden_DeleteAll): confirmation refused ("いいえ" default), accepted with LEFT+A, connect, TOP/DELE of every mail, result screens.
# Round 1 ('mail_server_hidden') only ran the third button "かんぜんにけす". Starts from the state left by 'mail_inbox'.
# Screen names = my reading of the screenshots.
# ---- run 1
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # title -> top menu
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # メール
waitstable 60 max 600
tap DOWN x5
wait 40
taplen 2
gap 0
tap A                        # メールサーバ
hold SELECT+LEFT 120         # exactly SELECT+LEFT while the state function runs
waitstable 60 max 600
shot notice
tap A                        # OK
waitstable 60 max 600
shot menu
tap A                        # かくにんしてからけす (hidden variant)
waitstable 60 max 600
shot check_confirm
tap A                        # はい
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # 0でつうしんをはじめる
waitstable 60 max 900
wait 1500
shot check_mail1
tap A                        # delete mail 1
wait 900
shot check_mail2
tap RIGHT
wait 30
tap A                        # skip mail 2
wait 900
shot check_mail3
tap A                        # delete mail 3
wait 900
shot check_mail4
tap RIGHT
wait 30
tap A                        # skip mail 4
wait 900
shot check_mail5
tap RIGHT x2
wait 30
tap A                        # end
wait 900
shot check_end
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot check_result_1
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot check_result_2
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot back_in_mail_menu
# ---- run 2 (power cycle)
reset
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # title -> top menu
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # メール
waitstable 60 max 600
tap DOWN x5
wait 40
taplen 2
gap 0
tap A                        # メールサーバ
hold SELECT+LEFT 120         # exactly SELECT+LEFT while the state function runs
waitstable 60 max 600
shot notice
tap A                        # OK
waitstable 60 max 600
shot menu2
tap DOWN
wait 40
shot menu_down
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot down_confirm
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot down_refused
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap LEFT
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot down_c2
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
wait 1500
shot down_deleting
waitstable 60 max 900
